{"id": "EUVD-2026-85267", "enisaUuid": "a1d9adee-c57a-3864-9f2c-8df843b1ab12", "description": "Buffer over-read vulnerability in Apache Tomcat Native during the TLS handshake permits a malicious user to trigger a DoS via a JVM crash.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat Native: from 2.0.0 through 2.0.15, from 1.3.0 through 1.3.8. Earlier, unsupported versions may also be affected.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 1.3.9 or 2.0.16, which fix the issue.", "datePublished": "2026-09-23T12:24:55", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-23T18:10:48", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://lists.apache.org/thread/8p4jf02w54m22x0cwpq2x53w3ov8o557"], "aliases": ["GHSA-w68h-fc49-cmrg", "CVE-2026-86243"], "assigner": "apache", "epss": 0.61, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "a02730cd-e1ef-397d-ae09-1f87f13c1344", "product": {"name": "Apache Tomcat Native", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 \u22642.0.15"}, {"id": "fe19b752-4e2c-3c5e-ac12-a2cd3c7773db", "product": {"name": "Apache Tomcat Native", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "1.3.0 \u22641.3.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ead461fb-8b03-38b9-b45c-765a31fd3e21", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}